WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.416
Welcome back, little explorer!

2
00:00:02.416 --> 00:00:03.847
Daisy Deer here.

3
00:00:03.847 --> 00:00:06.805
Today we learn about how are you feeling?!

4
00:00:07.914 --> 00:00:09.072
Are you ready?

5
00:00:09.072 --> 00:00:10.766
Let's find out together!

6
00:00:12.066 --> 00:00:12.863
Look!

7
00:00:12.863 --> 00:00:14.335
This is HAPPY.

8
00:00:14.335 --> 00:00:18.071
Happy is a warm, sunny feeling inside!

9
00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:21.173
Which one is HAPPY?

10
00:00:25.366 --> 00:00:29.968
Remember: Happy is a warm, sunny feeling inside!

11
00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:32.081
Look!

12
00:00:32.081 --> 00:00:33.372
This is SAD.

13
00:00:33.372 --> 00:00:36.942
Everyone feels sad sometimes, and that is okay!

14
00:00:38.454 --> 00:00:40.306
Can you say SAD with me?

15
00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:41.431
Let's try!

16
00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:46.461
Look!

17
00:00:46.461 --> 00:00:48.072
This is EXCITED.

18
00:00:48.072 --> 00:00:51.447
Excited is when you can hardly wait!

19
00:00:52.954 --> 00:00:54.776
Which one is EXCITED?

20
00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:03.245
Remember: Excited is when you can hardly wait!

21
00:01:04.542 --> 00:01:05.422
Wow!

22
00:01:05.422 --> 00:01:07.505
You learned so much today.

23
00:01:07.505 --> 00:01:09.603
I am so proud of you!

24
00:01:10.802 --> 00:01:13.182
Great job, my friend!

25
00:01:13.182 --> 00:01:16.140
Come back soon and we'll learn more.

26
00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:17.168
Bye bye!

27
00:01:18.182 --> 00:01:21.270
Try "Colors All Around Us" next!
